# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Ships as dist/_redirects.
#
# INERT until reachmck.com is registered AND both hostnames are attached to this
# Pages project in the Cloudflare dashboard. Until then the site is only served
# from reachmck.pages.dev and this rule never matches.
#
# Sends www to the bare apex, which is what <link rel="canonical"> in index.html
# and public/sitemap.xml already point at. If you'd rather make www canonical,
# reverse this rule and update those two files to match.

https://www.reachmck.com/* https://reachmck.com/:splat 301
